rofile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2cyeda2ss2j"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-15T02:21:09+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Denver Barkey rips one past Greaves, and the Flyers take the lead.\n\nNot gonna lie: I didn't like how much Acciari was playing in the 3rd period. But that was one hell of a play by him to bat down that clear. 4-3 Flyers.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2cxcblqok2j"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-15T01:10:04+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"Really liked the subtle little work by Porter Martone on that setup to create space for himself and work himself into a spot to find Barkey. That's his smarts and playmaking ability on display.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2ctd63hrk2j"},{"a":"Charlie O'Connor","d":"2026-11-15T01:09:23+00:00","h":"charlieoconn.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"And now Denver Barkey rips one from the slot on the ensuing power play. The Flyers have really turned this one around. 3-2 Flyers.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3n2ctbxlzjk2j"}],"team":"PHI","threads":[],"videos":[{"d":"2026-11-15T04:08:21+00:00","id":"D6yG1x5XNhk","k":"presser","t":"11/14 PHI @ CBJ Postgame: Denver Barkey","team":"PHI","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D6yG1x5XNhk"}]}